Package: firmware-motorola-rhodep
Version: 1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: rhodep port
Section: non-free/kernel
Priority: optional
Description: Vendor firmware for Motorola Moto G82 5G (rhodep, SM6375)
 WCN3990 WiFi/BT, Adreno 619 GPU (zap/gmu/sqe) and modem PD blobs, extracted
 from the stock vendor partition. NOT redistributable: see BUILD.md to extract
 from your own device and build this package. This control file is a template.
